        <!-- ── Part 1 ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <subsection xml:id="subsec-uart-part1">
            <title>Part 1: Does printf Work?</title>

            <!--
            INSTRUCTOR (5 min):
            Before students touch their boards, run the finished counter
            yourself: connect your Nucleo, open CoolTerm at 9600 baud,
            press reset.  Let them watch the output for a moment.
            Then switch CoolTerm to 4800 baud and ask the room:
